  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "When the US government ran Stargate, its secret programme of \"remote viewers\", people said to be able to see distant places with the mind, it reached out to about 600 people, and only six turned out to have real talent. All six are said to have had synesthesia, a condition where the senses blend together. The magician and video maker Chris Ramsay tells this to Michels without naming a source."
